#: ../../source/users/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Everything for building `cneta` and running `cnets`, `cnetml`, and "
"`cnetmcmc`: installing the tools, a minimal end-to-end walkthrough, per-tool"
" option and I/O reference, how the tools chain together, file formats, and "
"configuration patterns."
msgstr ""
"构建 `cneta` 以及运行 `cnets`、`cnetml`、`cnetmcmc` "
"所需的全部内容：安装、最简完整示例、各工具的参数和输入输出说明、工具之间如何衔接、文件格式和配置方式。"

